{
    "test_name": "MOB.551_AssetVerify_Reading_History",
    "details": {
        "name": "MOB.551_AssetVerify_Reading_History",
        "type": "browser",
        "status": "paused",
        "message": "`MOB.551` **The reading-history popover: its fetch states, the timeline/chart toggle, and the offline branch.**\n- READ-ONLY. Fixture is `MOB.550`'s residue on `Tank 0000` \u2014 the history icon renders only\n  beside a reading type with a previous entry, so this runs after `MOB.550` in `MOB.987`.\n- \u2b50 **RESOLVED is an exclusive-or**: `No readings recorded.` or >= 1 timeline item, polled\n  past `Loading history...`, which satisfies neither.\n- \u2b50 **Timeline vs chart is a biconditional** on the two containers, flipped and flipped back.\n- \u2b50 **Offline** via a dispatched `offline` event (`MOB.910`): the message appears, then\n  disappears on `online`. Restore legs are `alwaysExecute`.\n- The row is expanded by its chevron (the name navigates to the full-page detail) and the\n  popover closed and row collapsed on the way out.",
        "tags": [
            "Mobile",
            "env:dev",
            "Asset Verification",
            "Readings",
            "read-only"
        ],
        "locations": [
            "gcp:us-west2"
        ],
        "config": {
            "assertions": [],
            "config_variables": [
                {
                    "id": "fe7958bf-435f-4932-af8e-0931caab79e7",
                    "name": "MOBDEV",
                    "type": "global"
                }
            ],
            "request": {
